strong>hiện thực hóa</strong></span><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> toàn bộ hệ thống đó bằng code Java Spring AI thực tế.</span></span></p><h2 style=\"line-height:1.5;margin-bottom:7pt;margin-top:14pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#c8102e;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Bài 1: Xây Dựng ETL Pipeline Nạp Tài Liệu CRM Vào Supabase pgvector</strong></span></span></h2><ul style=\"margin-bottom:0;margin-top:0;padding-inline-start:48px;\"><li style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#262626;font-family:'Noto Sans Symbols',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;list-style-type:disc;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#262626;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Bối cảnh</strong></span><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">:</span></span></li></ul><p style=\"line-height:1.5;margin-bottom:6pt;margin-left:40px;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#262626;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Đội ngũ phát triển&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>CRM Ticket Assistant</strong></span><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> tại&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Rikkei Retail</strong></span><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> cần xây dựng pipeline nạp các tài liệu quy trình chăm sóc khách hàng (CSKH) dạng Markdown vào cơ sở dữ liệu vector để phục vụ tra cứu. Họ sử dụng Supabase Cloud với extension pgvector và mô hình Embedding local&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#8b0d1e;font-family:Consolas,sans-serif;font-size:10pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">nomic-embed-text</span></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#262626;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> (768 chiều) chạy qua Ollama.</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.5;margin-bottom:6pt;margin-left:40px;margin-top:0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#262626;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Cấu hình&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#8b0d1e;font-family:Consolas,sans-serif;font-size:10pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">application.yml</span></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#262626;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-we