;color:#8b0d1e;font-family:Consolas,sans-serif;font-size:10pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">CrmChatController</span></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#262626;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">.</span></span></li><li style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#262626;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;list-style-type:decimal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"2\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#262626;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Controller sử dụng&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#8b0d1e;font-family:Consolas,sans-serif;font-size:10pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">ChatClient</span></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#262626;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> được cấu hình với&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#8b0d1e;font-family:Consolas,sans-serif;font-size:10pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">QuestionAnswerAdvisor</span></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#262626;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;\"><span style=\"fon